  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo Desarrollo Integrado Sector Turismo en Salta</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Integrated Development Tourism Sector in Salta Province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program&apos;s objective is to contribute to the strengthening of the province fiscal performance. The activities to be taken include the modernization of the province&apos;s management capacity in the following areas: tax collection, registry, assessment of real state properties, and the expansion of the taxable bases through the reactivation of the economic activity in the tourism sector. It will also contrib. to the protec. soc. inversions through financ. soc. infrastruc. works.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
